  "instructions": [
    "Rinse the rice under cold water until clear, then drain.",
    "In a large skillet, melt butter over medium heat and sauté onion until translucent.",
    "Add minced garlic and grated ginger; cook for 1 minute until fragrant.",
    "Stir in ground allspice and cook for 30 seconds to toast the spices.",
    "Add sliced carrots and frozen peas, cooking for 2 minutes.",
    "Pour in diced tomatoes, coconut milk, vegetable broth, and bring to a simmer.",
    "Add rinsed rice, stir gently, then cover and reduce heat to low.",
    "Simmer uncovered for 18 minutes, or until rice is tender and liquid absorbed.",
    "Season with salt and black pepper to taste.",
    "Remove from heat, fluff rice with a fork, and serve hot."
  ],
